        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Fleischman, Jimmy Barnes, Neal Schon, Diane Valory, Steve Morse\n- Projects: \"Wheel in the Sky\", Living Loud\n- Topics: music careers, songwriting, rock music\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Fleischman was born on March 11, 1953, and he is an American musician, songwriter, and record producer.\n- Jimmy Barnes was born as James Dixon Swan on April 28, 1956, and he is a Scottish-Australian rock singer-songwriter.\n- The song \"Wheel in the Sky\" was written and composed by Robert Fleischman, Neal Schon, and Diane Valory.\n- The Living Loud project included Australian rock singer Jimmy Barnes and Deep Purple guitarist Steve Morse.",
